{"3768760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "007 First Light", "steam_appid": 3768760, "required_age": "13", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3986520], "detailed_description": "<h1>007 First Light - Reviews!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/aff3dabd991af439209a43bf0a5cf499.avif?t=1786116490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/aff3dabd991af439209a43bf0a5cf499.webp?t=1786116490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Get the Deluxe Edition now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6836e971b215d6695a6f984215bc3063.avif?t=1786116490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/6836e971b215d6695a6f984215bc3063.avif?t=1786116490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your espionage adventure with 007 First Light Deluxe Edition. Earn your number in style with 4 new outfits, 4 new gadget skins and a new weapon skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 outfits:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day of the Dead </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert Explorer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Anchor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentleman Operator   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon skin:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent’s Mark   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gleaming Pack, including 4 gadget skins:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Lighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Earphones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Phone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gleaming Pen</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Check out the full year one content overview!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/746c828fbff234da8208a6bcfc112021.avif?t=1786116490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/746c828fbff234da8208a6bcfc112021.avif?t=1786116490 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Launch is just the beginning for 007 First Light.  <br>Year one  is packed with new Tac Sim missions, Bawma's return, new gadgets, photomode, and more.</p></p><br><h1>PC Specs update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/db7aec77bd0d4e98b76664c51250d030.avif?t=1786116490\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras_big/db7aec77bd0d4e98b76664c51250d030.webp?t=1786116490 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what hardware you need to run 007 First Light at 1440p, 4K, and 4K Ultra on May 27th.<br><br>The team has been hard at work over the past few months and we are thrilled to reveal the Enthusiast and Ultra specs for 007 First Light. Get a breakdown of the hardware you need to play this re-imagined origin story at various resolutions, performance targets, and settings preset, as well as a highlight of our PC features and global accessibility options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >007 First Light at launch will feature an uncapped framerate, in addition to NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 Super Resolution and DLSS Dynamic Multi Frame Generation for great image quality and smooth performance. Path tracing and DLSS Ray Reconstruction for the ultimate visual quality arrive in Summer 2026.  </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/014b54d6b601b5d52bb93dd3c9fd9f0a.avif?t=1786116490\" width=924 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new standalone, re-imagined James Bond origin story, and the events that lead an audacious young hero to become the best MI6 agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.poster.avif?t=1786116490\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.webm?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/a5ebb0f93ae666179a3313ad207af9eb.mp4?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/079f0d9dd7b1f9ce87c98ef49110e7a8.avif?t=1786116490\" width=924 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on missions in breathtaking locations, drive iconic vehicles, and dive into a cinematic adventure in pursuit of a rogue agent who’s always one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.poster.avif?t=1786116490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.webm?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/0d16a21121f31042db9b4a102ed3725e.mp4?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/1911e1e0cf32017dc5ed0f3c4e4ba0f7.avif?t=1786116490\" width=924 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go silent or go loud. Whether fighting with fists or firepower, using gadgets to infiltrate, or bluffing your way past guards, the approach is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.poster.avif?t=1786116490\" width=1000 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.webm?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6a9da91fbfe553589fac0dadd275acd8.mp4?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/d5ea872ba5a578d39c68d2bf3596ef45.avif?t=1786116490\" width=924 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills and replay your favorite missions with additional modifiers, for endless espionage fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.poster.avif?t=1786116490\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.webm?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/89d95455f8fb51a198f517ffa9ad53c6.mp4?t=1786116490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/014b54d6b601b5d52bb93dd3c9fd9f0a.avif?t=1786116490\" width=924 height=81 /></span></